      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deerwood%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Although geographically inside Deerwood Township, the city of Deerwood operates as a separate municipal entity.",
